@startuml
title Two consumers, two time scales

rectangle "Raw VBUS" as raw
rectangle "Fast filter" as fast
rectangle "USB stack" as stack
rectangle "Policy debounce" as debounce
rectangle "Application route" as route

raw --> fast
fast --> stack : attach and unplug
raw --> debounce
debounce --> route : probe and fallback

note right of stack
  Fast reaction:
  physical state must remain truthful.
end note

note right of route
  Stable reaction:
  avoids transitions caused by glitches.
end note
@enduml
